{"type":"message","id":"e63dd9b2","parentId":"0ab1de8b","timestamp":"2026-03-13T06:54:46.666Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've confirmed that the week view, day view, and recurring task models exist. Now I need to run the tests and create a comprehensive test report. Let me first run all the existing tests to get the current status, then create tests for P1-1 and P1-4 if they don't exist.\n\nLet me also check the main_window.py to see how the views are integrated.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_db7bf5847f414598a160ac07","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/admin/.openclaw/workspace/todo-calendar && source venv/bin/activate && python -c \"\nfrom src.database.db_manager import init_database\nfrom src.ui.week_view import WeekView\nfrom src.ui.day_view import DayView\nfrom src.models.recurring_task import RecurringTask, RecurrenceType\nfrom src.services.task_service import TaskService\n\nprint('✅ WeekView module loaded successfully')\nprint('✅ DayView module loaded successfully')\nprint('✅ RecurringTask module loaded successfully')\nprint('✅ TaskService module loaded successfully')\nprint()\nprint('All P1 modules are available!')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"dashscope-coding","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":47502,"output":326,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47828,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773384876811}}
